  "description": "StockTok Weekly Wrap Up",
  "body_html": "<p>Quick note: I sold APLD this morning. I really did not want to, but considering Microsoft, a sector leader, is down -35% since last year’s highs, my concern is this company being pulled down as well. Its an annoying fact, that when a big name in a sector (tech here for example), goes belly up, it often times pulls the smaller companies with them, downward. Wanted to get out while still having a small profit. </p><p>I make decisions day to day, but I speculate that I will gradually trim positions, with the exception to Regional Banks. Those continue to push upwards. The <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a> which is finance heavy, is leading the S&amp;P 500 by about 6%. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NaVE!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NaVE!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NaVE!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NaVE!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NaVE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NaVE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png\" width=\"894\" height=\"736\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/afd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:736,&quot;width&quot;:894,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:87655,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/203701176?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NaVE!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NaVE!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NaVE!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!NaVE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fafd790c8-aed4-483c-9c36-a65743095b8d_894x736.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Regional banks have significant more runway ahead of them. </figcaption></figure></div><p>If you missed any of these posts from the week, check them out when you have a moment:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/top-stock-has-the-best-vcp-ive-seen?r=4z8lgl\">Bullish Stocks for the Month</a> - I bought the #1 Stock here Yesterday</p><ul><li><p>Blackberry was a top stock in this review, and it pumped +20% the next day. I review charts on the weekly timeframe, so even though it ran immediately, I still expect more continuation (though not necessarily in a strait line), upwards, over time. </p></li></ul></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/jeremy-grantham-says-to-sell-all?r=4z8lgl\">A Reputable Bear is suggesting to sell everything…</a></p><ul><li><p>And no…Michael Burry is not a reputable bear. In fact, he sucks. A lot. Consistent losses year after year after year. </p></li></ul></li></ul><p>I hope you all have a nice weekend. One final note, I am traveling next Wednesday through Friday to visit my Dad. I will pop in, so feel free to tag me still, but I will not be in here all day long. I’ll probably answer tagged questions in the evening. </p><p>Be sure to take a break from the markets and the charts….staying fresh is critical! </p><p>Thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>",
